    },
    {
      "claim": "L3 oral AUC/Cmax records concern naloxone-3-glucuronide, ezetimibe glucuronide, and glucosamine sulfate; they do not measure oral bioavailability of the query or a sufficiently close covalent sulfated disaccharide.",
