  "decision_summary": "The query is an extremely polar, fully ionized sulfated disaccharide. Direct human F values for closely related sulfated/polar molecules are all well below 20%, and L4 Caco-2/PAMPA data for sulfated glycosaminoglycans and glucuronides show low permeability. The low prediction is retained with high confidence."
